{"4440080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "It Comes At Night", "steam_appid": 4440080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a quiet, abandoned mansion and uncover the secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person psychological exploration experience focuses on atmosphere, subtle storytelling, and a growing sense of unease. There are no weapons, no combat, and no clear guidance—only your curiosity pushing you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, open forgotten rooms, and examine objects left behind. Every detail matters. From small environmental clues to distant, unexplained sounds, the mansion slowly reveals fragments of its past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to create tension without relying on traditional horror elements. Instead of constant threats, it builds fear through silence, isolation, and the feeling that something isn’t quite right.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440080/extras/d6a0f5d14f368a9345fc15afb5af478f.avif?t=1785803949\" width=1297 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a quiet, abandoned mansion and uncover the secrets hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person psychological exploration experience focuses on atmosphere, subtle storytelling, and a growing sense of unease. There are no weapons, no combat, and no clear guidance—only your curiosity pushing you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, open forgotten rooms, and examine objects left behind. Every detail matters. From small environmental clues to distant, unexplained sounds, the mansion slowly reveals fragments of its past.</p